---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for B&A Insurance Producers (bowthorpeinsurance.com)."
>
  <section class="bg-[#016490] text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-white/70 mt-2">Effective Date: January 1, 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <p>B&A Insurance Producers (Bowthorpe & Associates) ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you visit bowthorpeinsurance.com or contact our agency.</p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect personal information you provide when you request a quote, fill out a contact form, or call our office, including your name, email address, phone number, address, and coverage needs.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you provide to respond to your inquiries, provide insurance quotes, and communicate with you about your coverage options. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
      <h2>Medicare Disclosure</h2>
      <p>By providing your information for Medicare purposes, you grant permission for a licensed insurance agent to contact you regarding Medicare Supplement, Medicare Advantage, and Prescription Drug Plan options.</p>
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@bowthorpeinsurance.com">info@bowthorpeinsurance.com</a> or call <a href="tel:8014872300">(801) 487-2300</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
